{"id":1060501,"chapter_id":1060501,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"眼前的女孩出神地坐在审查椅上，一动不动，像个真正的人偶。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501003,"trial_step":3,"drawing":1060500},{"step":2,"options":["伊芙？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501004,"trial_step":4,"course":3,"drawing":1060500},{"step":3,"content":"伊芙的睫毛颤了颤，但她并没有抬头，似乎还没有想好该怎么和你交流。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501005,"trial_step":5,"drawing":1060500},{"step":4,"content":"审查室内，是难以化开的冰窖般的寂静。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501006,"trial_step":6,"drawing":1060500},{"step":5,"content":"她身上火灾造成的外伤已经治愈，但诊所对她的评估却并不乐观。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501007,"trial_step":7,"drawing":1060500},{"step":6,"speaker":"医师","content":"她其实没有严重的生命危险，那么大的火，居然能好好活着，还真是奇迹。","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501009,"trial_step":9},{"step":7,"speaker":"医师","content":"救援队找到她的时候，她在石板缝里，没受什么伤害。","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501010,"trial_step":10},{"step":8,"content":"伊芙被救出后，第一时间就被送往了就近的辛迪加诊所。你接到消息后，也立刻赶往了诊所。","style":3,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501011,"trial_step":11},{"step":9,"content":"伊芙性命无虞，然而医师的眉头却一直紧锁。","style":3,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501012,"trial_step":12},{"step":10,"speaker":"医师","content":"我们对她进行了全面的检查，发现最严重的问题不在于火灾的影响。","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501013,"trial_step":13},{"step":11,"content":"最严重的……是什么？","style":2,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501014,"trial_step":14},{"step":12,"speaker":"医师","content":"……你对她的腿，了解多少？","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501015,"trial_step":15},{"step":13,"content":"调查没出错的话，她的腿是在小时候发生的一起车祸事故中出意外的。和工厂的经历以及狂厄污染都没有关系。","style":2,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501016,"trial_step":16},{"step":14,"speaker":"医师","content":"但是禁闭者理应拥有更神奇强健的身体素质。","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501017,"trial_step":17},{"step":15,"speaker":"医师","content":"断臂的神经会拥有超凡的活性。以禁闭者的体质，即便只剩一个大脑，也可以与全身的机器义肢融合。","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501018,"trial_step":18},{"step":16,"speaker":"医师","content":"根据检查结果显示，她的义肢和剩下的神经，没有丝毫融合的迹象。","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501019,"trial_step":19},{"step":17,"content":"你的意思是，她原本是有可能站起来的？","style":2,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501020,"trial_step":20},{"step":18,"speaker":"医师","content":"对……","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501021,"trial_step":21},{"step":19,"content":"医师叹着气，交给你一叠报告。","style":3,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501022,"trial_step":22},{"step":20,"speaker":"医师","content":"她最严重的问题，不是身体，而是心理。","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501023,"trial_step":23},{"step":21,"speaker":"医师","content":"不想求生的人，怎么还会想要站起来呢？","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501024,"trial_step":24},{"step":22,"content":"诊所病房门的小小监视窗里，伊芙坐着轮椅靠在窗边出神。她的手边是没有被碰过的餐盘和药片。","style":3,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501025,"trial_step":25},{"step":23,"speaker":"医师","content":"我们没收了所有尖锐物品，但她还是数度想要轻生。","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501026,"trial_step":26},{"step":24,"speaker":"医师","content":"后来，她可能是觉得自己如果做出什么过激的行为会成为我们诊所的负担。就一直这么坐着发呆了。","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501027,"trial_step":27},{"step":25,"speaker":"医师","content":"也就是看见你，她才有一点反应。你或许是她在这个世界上，唯一认识的、愿意交流的人了。","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501028,"trial_step":28},{"step":26,"content":"……","style":2,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501029,"trial_step":29},{"step":27,"content":"口袋里，MBCC的通讯终端一直在震动。你知道有更重要的任务需要你行动。","style":3,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501030,"trial_step":30},{"step":28,"options":["接通通讯"],"style":6,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501031,"trial_step":31,"course":3},{"step":29,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长！FAC净化部队在BR-004封锁区发现狂厄污染的异常增长。","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501032,"trial_step":32},{"step":30,"content":"我马上就回来……","style":2,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501033,"trial_step":33},{"step":31,"content":"出发之前能给我留出一点时间吗？不用太久。","style":2,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501034,"trial_step":34},{"step":32,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"有什么要做的吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501035,"trial_step":35},{"step":33,"content":"我和伊芙，还有话要说。","style":2,"background":120,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501036,"trial_step":36},{"step":34,"content":"伊芙。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501037,"trial_step":37,"drawing":1060500},{"step":35,"content":"你又叫了一次，她终于有了些回应。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1060500},{"step":36,"speaker":"伊芙","content":"嗯……","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1060500},{"step":37,"content":"伊芙似乎还是不敢抬起头直视，你调低了直射的灯光，不至于晃到她的眼睛。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1060500},{"step":38,"content":"你应该记得我吧。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1060500},{"step":39,"speaker":"伊芙","content":"当然。灰色的布娃娃，你替家人们传递了真正的声音，我不会忘记的。","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1060500},{"step":40,"content":"我们第一次对话，我还是个布娃娃。第二次，你被狂厄控制了意识。第三次，是在这种地方。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1060500},{"step":41,"content":"这里的环境你恐怕不太习惯吧？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501044,"trial_step":44,"drawing":1060500},{"step":42,"speaker":"伊芙","content":"没关系……冷冰冰的，也很好。","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1060501},{"step":43,"speaker":"伊芙","content":"我习惯这样的地方了，锈河深处的工厂也是冷冰冰的。我平时也和现在一样，坐在硬邦邦的椅子上。","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1060501},{"step":44,"speaker":"伊芙","content":"但现在，那个我最熟悉的地方已经没有了吧？","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1060501},{"step":45,"speaker":"伊芙","content":"已经变成了一片废墟，只剩我一个了……","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1060501},{"step":46,"speaker":"伊芙","content":"是我给你们添麻烦了。","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1060501},{"step":47,"content":"伊芙的手不安地交握，你能感受到，她在努力隐藏自己的情绪。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1060501},{"step":48,"content":"不只有你，其实在废墟里找到你时，救援队还发现了一些东西。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1060501},{"step":49,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":52,"course":6,"drawing":1060501},{"step":50,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":52,"course":6,"drawing":1060501},{"step":51,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置3","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":52,"course":6,"drawing":1060501},{"step":52,"options":["选择1"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":52,"course":6,"drawing":1060501},{"step":53,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置4","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":52,"course":6,"drawing":1060501},{"step":54,"options":["选择1","选择2"],"jump":[7,9],"style":4,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":52,"course":6,"drawing":1060501},{"step":55,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":52,"course":6,"drawing":1060501},{"step":56,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":52,"course":6,"drawing":1060501},{"step":57,"content":"残破的碎片带着火后的灰烬，已经变成了一堆扔进锈河也不会被发现的破烂。但伊芙还是一眼认出了它们。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501053,"trial_step":53,"drawing":1060502},{"step":58,"speaker":"伊芙","content":"这些是——","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1060502},{"step":59,"speaker":"伊芙","content":"我做的玩具家人？","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1060502},{"step":60,"content":"发现你的时候，这些碎片包围在你身边。如果我没猜错的话，它们救了你。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1060502},{"step":61,"content":"伊芙有些不可置信，指尖颤抖着想要靠近又倏地收回。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1060502},{"step":62,"speaker":"伊芙","content":"明明只是我制造出来的玩具而已……","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1060502},{"step":63,"speaker":"伊芙","content":"只是被我赋予了记忆和性格……明明只是一场过家家。","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501059,"trial_step":59,"drawing":1060502},{"step":64,"content":"记忆和性格，足以模拟出半个真正的灵魂了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1060502},{"step":65,"content":"对你而言的过家家，对玩具们来说，却是一段很长的、真实发生的时光吧？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501061,"trial_step":61,"drawing":1060502},{"step":66,"speaker":"伊芙","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1060501},{"step":67,"content":"伊芙思绪复杂地看着眼前的灰烬，咬咬唇。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1060501},{"step":68,"speaker":"巴斯","content":"咯咯——！","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"background":2164,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501064,"trial_step":64},{"step":69,"speaker":"伊芙","content":"以后你就叫巴斯了，你和本纳的关系最好。如果本纳忘记了什么，你也要提醒他。","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"background":2164,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501065,"trial_step":65},{"step":70,"speaker":"伊芙","content":"洋娃娃就叫宝莉，你要记住，你曾经是世界上最善良的女孩子。","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"background":2164,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501066,"trial_step":66},{"step":71,"speaker":"宝莉","content":"我叫……宝莉。","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"background":2164,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501067,"trial_step":67},{"step":72,"speaker":"伊芙","content":"嗯，这个是套娃妈妈，马蕾莎。","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"background":2164,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501068,"trial_step":68},{"step":73,"content":"伊芙视线从他们身上一一扫过……","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501069,"trial_step":69,"drawing":1060501},{"step":74,"speaker":"伊芙","content":"笨蛋……又是这样，又是因为我，把自己变成这幅样子……","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501070,"trial_step":70,"drawing":1060501},{"step":75,"content":"你为他们设定的身份，已经注定了他们会和之前的家人一样保护你。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501071,"trial_step":71,"drawing":1060501},{"step":76,"speaker":"伊芙","content":"是啊，一样……一样骗我一切都会变好，然后留我一个人去面对一点都不好的现实……","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501072,"trial_step":72,"drawing":1060501},{"step":77,"speaker":"伊芙","content":"你们真的希望我醒来吗？醒来，真的要比睡着更好吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_65"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501073,"trial_step":73,"drawing":1060502},{"step":78,"content":"她真诚又困惑的看着眼前面目全非的玩具，小心地拉住了你的袖子，好像在期待眼前的大人能给出成熟的解答。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501074,"trial_step":74,"drawing":1060502},{"step":79,"content":"现实，会更好么……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501075,"trial_step":75,"drawing":1060502},{"step":80,"content":"这个问题，那只暴躁的玩具熊问过我，其实好多人问过我……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501076,"trial_step":76,"drawing":1060502},{"step":81,"speaker":"伊芙","content":"都是和我一样的人？","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_69"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501077,"trial_step":77,"drawing":1060500},{"step":82,"content":"有一些相似之处吧。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501078,"trial_step":78,"drawing":1060500},{"step":83,"content":"她们……有的失去了自己最亲近的依靠，有的面对患者的离开无能为力，有的在小土坑里守着要清除所有死役的愿望……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501079,"trial_step":79,"drawing":1060500},{"step":84,"content":"还有人，眼睁睁看着无辜的少女异化成怪物却无能为力，亲手杀死善良的忠义之士却无法挽回，想救所有人但力量永远不够强大……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501080,"trial_step":80,"drawing":1060500},{"step":85,"content":"伊芙捕捉到了你情绪的变化，拉住你袖子的手指不安地揉搓。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501081,"trial_step":81,"drawing":1060500},{"step":86,"speaker":"伊芙","content":"这些人，都怎么样了？","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_74"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501082,"trial_step":82,"drawing":1060501},{"step":87,"content":"都醒着，知道现实的残酷，知道自己所相信的有可能都是谎言和泡影，但还在往前走。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501083,"trial_step":83,"drawing":1060501},{"step":88,"speaker":"伊芙","content":"是怎么做到的？","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_76"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501084,"trial_step":84,"drawing":1060501},{"step":89,"content":"忍耐，直到有一天，能把谎言变成真的。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501085,"trial_step":85,"drawing":1060501},{"step":90,"speaker":"伊芙","content":"谎言，也可以是真的……？","voice":["vo_trial_60501_1_78"],"voice_bank":"vo_eve_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":160501086,"trial_step":86,"drawing":1060502},{"step":91,"co